    "value_statement": "Complex systems are hard to explain with plain text. This skill creates polished HTML and SVG diagrams for reviews, documentation, and planning.",
    "seo_keywords": [
      "Claude",
      "Codex",
      "Claude Code",
      "architecture diagram",
