        "question": "Can diagrams work offline?",
        "answer": "Yes, if you remove or self-host the Google Fonts link. The default template otherwise requests Google Fonts."
      },
      {
        "question": "Does it draw cloud-specific diagrams?",
        "answer": "Yes. It includes styles for cloud regions, security groups, storage, load balancers, and common services."
